  "rationale": "16 units of Curd 500ML at Outlet 03 (South Bengaluru) are projected unsold before the expiry deadline on 2026-09-21; doing nothing writes off ₹617 and a blanket 20% markdown costs ₹299. This play uses a bundle with SKU-KHARI-400G at ₹87 for 227 consented customers (Everyday staples shoppers, Tea connoisseurs, Dairy occasionals, Festival sweets loyalists): expected 16 units, margin ₹119, discount cost ₹128, waste avoided ₹617 (CI 1 to 47 units; prior n 20, measured n 0). Policy v1: \"2. Prefer bundles and transfers over blanket markdowns; markdowns are the last lever.\" This bundle play pairs Curd 500ML with Khari 400G at a bundle price of 87 INR, which maintains the margin above the category floor of 8.0% and is preferred over markdowns by the policy. It targets high-affinity segments to clear the 16 units at risk before expiry.",
